                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2397] If the OCSP response for a particular certificate is not available from an OCSP responder that has a certificate derived from one of the PE private root CA certificates supported by the EVCC (EVCC provided a list of the V2G certificates via [V2G20-1006] or it received from the private SECC via [V2G20-2385]), private SECC shall omit providing OCSP response for that certificate in the \"ServerHello\" message.",
